{"reviewId": "49984910_7XKUinhFl", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "正弦函数的四段，前两段在x轴上方，包括了顶（1）；后两段在x轴下方，包括了底（-1）。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "2025-2121", "abstract": "需要注意的是，如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "reviewId": "49984910_7XKUinhFl", "userVid": 49984910, "topics": [], "createTime": 1738820387, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 49984910, "name": "Lil Rene🍉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/y5YGHXGn9VN4amsXGDe5eP12BFZunO26W7tVOjI4gNfxQ3IY9ibMfF5sDGibLibk10Vj6Ddq4bCogwrE8uXkA3JIPVibxPNnCxicTl3s2YD22JoY/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 28048808, "name": "Yellow", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0028-N5~wmWTPyGOIY2IGPlA~_d8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Yellow", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "女", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-2-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "错了，繁荣是x轴下方加速往上走的过程，衰退是x轴上方减速往上走到波顶，萧条是x轴上方加速往下走，回升是x轴下方减速走到谷底。这样才能对应正文中，所说的“顶指的是衰退期的结束”和“康波的谷指的是回升的结束”", "reviewId": "49984910_7XKUinhFl", "commentId": "49984910_7XK